<title>USA: Centennial Technologies gets record orders.</title>
<headline>Centennial Technologies gets record orders.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial Technologies Inc said on Thursday the company received orders at a record level during the first quarter of its fiscal year ending June 30 1997.</p>
<p>It received orders of approximately $37 million during the quarter ended September 30 1996, compared to aprroximately $10 million for the same quarter of the previous year. For the quarter ended June 30 it received orders of approximately $30 million.</p>
<p>Centennial provides contract manufacturing services.</p>
</text>
